# Cursor Rules
- Always read `docs/MASTER_CONTEXT.md` first.
- Recreate / operate from `docs/RUNBOOK.md`.
- Log sessions in `docs/PROGRESS.md`. App facts in `docs/settings/`.
- GitHub: https://github.com/ixamal/stems — docs + `py/` helpers. Never commit audio, stems, NML, TSI, master.db, or `m3u/*.m3u`.
- Git authorship: David alone. No `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor trailer.
- Do not change Traktor / NUO-STEMS / Audio MIDI Setup without a documented rollback.

# Rig
- Machine: David / Mac (Apple Silicon), host `ix`
- NUO-STEMS 4 (Alex / DJ NUO) licensed on the same Mac as Traktor Pro 4.5.1 — functional reference, not the batch tool
- Generator: local CLI (`py.exec.separate`). Default NUO mode if opened: Legacy / Export (Same as Original). Native is parked.
- Library: 35k+ under stems_audio. Organize lives in https://github.com/ixamal/music_migration
- Mixer / BlackHole lives in https://github.com/ixamal/blackhole — different repo, different chat

# Phases
1. Four-pack from `m3u/nuo_queue_test4.m3u` proved in Traktor (2026-08-23).
2. Batch `m3u/` queues, then the 35k+ crate. CLI only.
3. Stretch: DAW splits for Maschine only if David asks.

# Journal
